*
!.gitignore

# Seed artwork ships with the repository so a fresh deploy has real product
# pictures. Everything else (product uploads, banners, payment proofs) is
# ignored because those are created at runtime.
!categories/
!categories/*.jpg
!categories/*.jpeg
!categories/*.png
!categories/*.webp

!logos/
!logos/*.jpg
!logos/*.jpeg
!logos/*.png
!logos/*.svg
!logos/*.webp
